sequenceDiagram
  actor Staff
  participant Web as Web form
  participant Server as Internal API
  participant Mock as External API

  Staff->>Web: Submit the quote form
  alt A field fails the shared schema
    Web-->>Staff: Catalog message on the field
    Note over Web,Mock: The browser does not call the server
  else The form is valid
    Web->>Server: POST /v1/quotes
    alt The server rejects the body
      Server-->>Web: 400 invalid_request
      Web-->>Staff: Catalog message, form still filled
    else The server accepts the body
      Server->>Mock: POST /v1/quotes with api-key
      alt Key missing or wrong, mock error, or unreadable body
        Mock-->>Server: 401 or 500, or the connection fails
        Server-->>Web: 500 vendor_unavailable
        Note over Server: A bad server key is not described as a key problem
      else The mock does not answer before the deadline
        Server-->>Web: 504 vendor_timeout
        Note over Server: One attempt, no retry
      else The mock returns 429
        Mock-->>Server: 429 and optional Retry-After
        Server-->>Web: 429 rate_limited
      else The mock returns 503
        Mock-->>Server: 503 and optional Retry-After
        Server-->>Web: 503 service_unavailable
        Note over Server: A temporary outage, distinct from vendor_unavailable
      end
      Web-->>Staff: Catalog message, form still filled
    end
  end
